# Phase 1A reads NO environment variable.
#
# This file exists deliberately, and is deliberately empty of settings, to make
# that explicit rather than leaving its absence ambiguous.
#
# The package has no database, no connection string, no API key, and no secret.
# The test suite and the demonstration run entirely against synthetic fixtures
# and an in-memory repository.
#
# Phase 1B will introduce adapter configuration. When it does, it must never
# introduce a direct connection to the shared Supabase instance used by Lapemo.
# See docs/SECURITY_AND_PRIVACY.md.
